usage: bridge [-h] {run,dump,validate} ...

ROS 2 → InfluxDB 2 telemetry bridge

positional arguments:
  {run,dump,validate}
    run                Forward configured topics
    dump               Export all visible topic/type pairs to YAML
    validate           Check config/schema and current graph without database
                       writes

options:
  -h, --help           show this help message and exit
